        "title": "05-ELECTROCHEMISTRY - Electrochemistry",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Rules (in order of priority):\n1. Free element: OS = 0\n2. Monatomic ion: OS = charge\n3. H = +1 (except metal hydrides: H = −1)\n4. O = −2 (except peroxides O₂²⁻: O = −1; OF₂: O = +2)\n5. F = −1 always\n6. Group 1 = +1, Group 2 = +2 in compounds\n7. Sum of OS = charge of species (0 for neutral)"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-ELECTROCHEMISTRY.md#020",
      "path": [
        "05-ELECTROCHEMISTRY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
