        "title": "05-ELECTROCHEMISTRY - Electrochemistry",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nAssign OS in Cr₂O₇²⁻:\n  2(OS_Cr) + 7(−2) = −2\n  2(OS_Cr) = 12\n  OS_Cr = +6   (dichromate — very oxidizing)"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-ELECTROCHEMISTRY.md#021",
      "path": [
        "05-ELECTROCHEMISTRY.md"
