        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "05-ELECTROCHEMISTRY - Electrochemistry",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "In Cr³⁺: OS = +3. Reduction: Cr⁶⁺ → Cr³⁺ (gains 3 e⁻ per Cr, 6 total for Cr₂O₇²⁻)\n```"
    },
