        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nUnbalanced: MnO₄⁻ + Fe²⁺ → Mn²⁺ + Fe³⁺  (acidic solution)"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-ELECTROCHEMISTRY.md#024",
      "path": [
        "05-ELECTROCHEMISTRY.md"
