        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "05-ELECTROCHEMISTRY - Electrochemistry",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "STEP 1: Write half-reactions\n  Oxidation:   Fe²⁺ → Fe³⁺ + e⁻\n  Reduction:   MnO₄⁻ → Mn²⁺"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-ELECTROCHEMISTRY.md#025",
      "path": [
        "05-ELECTROCHEMISTRY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
