        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "05-ELECTROCHEMISTRY - Electrochemistry",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "STEP 2: Balance O with H₂O, H with H⁺, charge with e⁻\n  Reduction:   MnO₄⁻ + 8H⁺ + 5e⁻ → Mn²⁺ + 4H₂O"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-ELECTROCHEMISTRY.md#026",
      "path": [
        "05-ELECTROCHEMISTRY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
