        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "05-ELECTROCHEMISTRY - Electrochemistry",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "STEP 3: Multiply to equalize electrons\n  Oxidation × 5:   5Fe²⁺ → 5Fe³⁺ + 5e⁻\n  Reduction × 1:   MnO₄⁻ + 8H⁺ + 5e⁻ → Mn²⁺ + 4H₂O"
    },
